    "project": "research/start_invariant_rho_audit_20261114/lean",
    "theorem": "StartInvariantRhoAudit.start_invariant_rho_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem start_invariant_rho_certificate : (∀ (q : ℕ) [NeZero q] (I : Type*) [Fintype I] [DecidableEq I] (w : I → ℝ) (hw0 : ∀ i, 0 ≤ w i) (hw : ∑ i, w i = 1) (g : I → ZMod q), jointMean q w hw0 hw g = expectation w (fun h : Hash (ZMod q) I => (firstCollision q (step g h) 0 : ℝ)) ∧ (∀ (a : ZMod q) (φ : ℕ → ℝ), expectation w (fun h : Hash (ZMod q) I => φ (firstCollision q (step g h) a)) = expectation w (fun h : Hash (ZMod q) I => φ (firstCollision q (step g h) 0)))) ∧ (∀ (q : ℕ) [NeZero q], 1902 < q → TwoStepCollisionAudit.DegreeTwoGeneric (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.increments q) ∧ (∀ (h : Hash (ZMod q) (Fin 20)) (a : ZMod q), q ≤ 951 * firstCollision q (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.transition q h) a ∧ firstCollision q (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.transition q h) a ≤ q) ∧ uniformMean q = ∑ z : GeneralTwoStepCollisionAudit.JointSample (ZMod q) (Fin 20), (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.localLaw q z).toReal * (firstCollision q (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.transition q z.1) z.2.1 : ℝ) ∧ uniformMean q = SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.meanCollision q ∧ (q : ℝ) ≤ 951 * uniformMean q ∧ uniformMean q ≤ q ∧ (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.localLaw q).toOuterMeasure (GeneralTwoStepCollisionAudit.freshEvent (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.increments q) : Set (GeneralTwoStepCollisionAudit.JointSample (ZMod q) (Fin 20))) = ENNReal.ofReal ((7581 : ℝ) / (8000 * q))) ∧ (∀ C : ℕ, ∃ (q : ℕ) (hq : Nat.Prime q), 1902 < q ∧ (C : ℝ) * q < (@uniformMean q ⟨hq.ne_zero⟩)^2) ∧ (¬∃ C : ℝ, ∀ (q : ℕ) (hq : Nat.Prime q), 1902 < q → TwoStepCollisionAudit.DegreeTwoGeneric (SidonRhoCounterfamilyAudit.increments q) → (@uniformMean q ⟨hq.ne_zero⟩)^2 ≤ C * q) ∧ Nat.Prime 10000019 ∧ (4 : ℝ) * 10000019 < (uniformMean 10000019)^2",
    "decl_sha256": "67e5dab5404c635114f843a3257bb0556c706a3a6359d7ecffd69373015c65b7",
    "scope": "Exact actual static product-hash translation invariance and starting-point law bridge. For arbitrary finite additive commutative state group and real label weights, actual domain translation is a hash equivalence preserving actual product weights and every weighted hash-observable expectation. For every nonzero cyclic modulus, finite labels and actual additive step table, actual iterate conjugacy proves exact leastrepeat Nat.find equality. Every real test function of actual firstcollision has identical expectation at every starting state. For arbitrary normalized nonnegative label PMF, actual expected firstcollision under the unchanged genuine joint static-hash/two-independent-uniform-ordered-start PMF equals the actual zero-start mean, derived from actual pointmass, finite sum exchange, start invariance and actual group cardinalities, without a distribution/count/probability conclusion premise. Frozen actual20 shifted Sidon family then has p<=951T and T<=p for every hash/start, genuine uniform-start mean exactlyequal to oldE, same actual jointPMF as source-qualified fresh two-step local event7581/(8000p), and E²/p unbounded over primes with direct real uniform-bound negation retaining sourceguards. Kernel-checked prime10000019/E²>4p transferred to actual uniform-start sampler. Known finite reindexing/translation method credited; closes exact sampler/start comparison only. No novelty or qualified random-step-table ensemble/practicalhash/asymptotic-constant refutation. Standard foundations/defaults; no holes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/flags/limits/waivers/newcryptoexperiment/spend/upload. Native writtenheader processing is procedural, not kernel parser/hash/physicalhost/execution refinement.",
